=== trend-failure foil (synthetic +0.15%/day drift) ===
mr_on_trend net_SR=-0.231 NAV=0.9839 stop_exits=1
invalidation_list:
 1) repeated stops in a one-way trend
 2) z thresholds estimated on full sample
 3) gap through stop — close-only understates
 4) cost+turnover after whipsaw
 5) HL → ∞ (unit-root) — mean reversion thesis invalid

